OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Bishop surprises Sean Styles
OL,4,Aduring final radio show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liverpool comic recalled appearing
OL,7,Fon a television entertainment show
OL,8,Falongside Styles many years ago, at a
OL,9,Ftime when he was still finding his feet
OL,10,Fas a stand-up performer.
